#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0367 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "No ACTARM column at all. Requirements.Variables.All [ACTARM] gates -> auditable skip naming the absent variable. ACTARM is Perm in ADSL (adamig 1-3), so this is the sanctioned reporting-use pattern (AD0367-F1). A DM block carrying the join key(s) is present so that the absent primary ACTARM is the ONLY reason to skip: without it the key's All_Or_None pairing group (PLAN-join-key-authoring-gate) would skip the rule as well, and this scenario would stop proving its own claim."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
---
S1 | 01-701-1015
---

dataset DM label=Demographics
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ACTARM  type=Char
---
S1 | DM | 01-701-1015 | Placebo
